{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a beautiful, modern Collections showcase section for a premium Indian ethnic fashion brand called Stylon.

    **Layout:**
    - Responsive grid: 5 columns on desktop, 4 columns on iPad/tablet, 2 columns on mobile
    - Section settings: heading text, heading alignment, section padding, left/right side padding (default 0), background color, overlay opacity, card border radius (default 8px), gap between cards
    - Show up to N collections at a time (configurable setting for how many cards to display, default 10)
    - "View All" button at top right of section heading row (no arrow icon, no animation/movement effect on hover)
    - Different heading font size settings for desktop and mobile (both editable)
    - Heading color editable

    **Single Collection Block:**
    - One single collection picker per block (select a Shopify collection — do NOT hardcode)
    - Optional custom title override
    - Optional custom image override
    - Up to 10+ collection blocks supported

    **Card Design:**
    - Full-bleed collection image
    - Collection title displayed BELOW the image (not overlaid on image)
    - Title in uppercase, with letter-spacing, modern clean typography, editable title color
    - Slight border-radius (8px), minimal soft box-shadow (lighter shadow on hover, not heavier)
    - Hover effect: image zoom only (subtle scale transform), title color changes to gold (#c9922a) on hover — NO moving/sliding/lifting card effect, NO underline on title
    - Dark luxury editorial feel: minimal, elegant, high-end fashion

    **Sale Tag Feature:**
    - If any product in the collection has a sale/discount, show a "SALE" tag at the top-right corner of the card image
    - Toggle option in section settings to enable/disable this sale tag feature

    **Scroll Animation:**
    - Subtle fade-in animation on scroll for the grid cards

    **No animations or movement effects on the View All button or card container — hover effects limited to image zoom + title color change only.**, give collection title editing options like uppercase , alignment, weight as well. also give option for heading title edit same as collection title. also give option to change disntance between heading and collection grid. give option for card border, add someelgant shadow, professional and modern show to card. keep it minimal. also give option to toggle it on off, dont add reveal effect, keep shows sudtle and soft and minimal . it should not go so much away from card., add view all button as well and top right, add view all button at top right, give view all button hover title color option, make view all button look good . give background color. font size, color, wight, letter spacing., have some good line height in collection title, card background color option add it. also collection title font size, wieght, case, spacing. add it, add background image add option for collection card, GIVE different card gap options for desktop and mobile, ADD SECTION HEADING FONT WEIGHT ,CASE, AND CHARAC SPACING OPTIONS. Also if any product inside that collection is on sale then card should show sale that at top right. it should be editable., you removed card background image option. add it. dont remove any existing option now. just add ., keep view all button border radius. jsut add. dont remove any option which is currently present here, MAKE view all slightly small keep it editable, add background image option for card, add background image option for card. keep all current options dont remove any existing option.
{% enddoc %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

{% style %}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
  width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
  padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 0;
  background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  --heading-font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_desktop }}px;
  --title-font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_desktop }}px;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_grid_gap }}px;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
  margin: 0;
  color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  font-size: var(--heading-font-size);
  font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }};
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
  text-transform: {{ block.settings.heading_case }};
  text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};

  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    {{ block.settings.heading_gradient_start }} 0%,
    {{ block.settings.heading_gradient_end }} 100%
  );

  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  background: {{ block.settings.view_background }};
  color: {{ block.settings.view_color }};
  font-size: {{ block.settings.view_size }}px;
  font-weight: {{ block.settings.view_weight }};
  letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.view_spacing }}px;
  border-radius: {{ block.settings.view_radius }}px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: {{ block.settings.desktop_card_gap }}px;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};

  {% if block.settings.card_background_image %}
    background-image: url('{{ block.settings.card_background_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  {% endif %}

  border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;

  box-shadow:
    {% if block.settings.show_shadow %}
      0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.07)
    {% else %}
      none
    {% endif %};

  text-decoration: none;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale {
  position: absolute;
  top: 10px;
  right: 10px;
  z-index: 2;
  padding: 5px 9px;
  background: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_background }};
  color: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_color }};
  font-size: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_size }}px;
  font-weight: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_weight }};
  border-radius: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_radius }}px;
  line-height: 1;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .5px;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media {
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.22;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform .3s ease;
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 14px 10px 16px;
   font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
  font-size: var(--title-font-size);
  font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_weight }};
  line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
  letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}px;
  text-align: {{ block.settings.title_alignment }};
  text-transform: {{ block.settings.title_case }};
}

.ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title {
  color: {{ block.settings.title_hover_color }};
}

@media (max-width: 989px) {
  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    --heading-font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_mobile }}px;
    --title-font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 749px) {

  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_section_padding }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    font-size: var(--heading-font-size);
  }

  .ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_grid_gap_mobile }}px;
  }
}

{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>

  {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}

    <div class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head">

      <h2 class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">
        {{ block.settings.heading }}
      </h2>

      {% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}
        <a
          class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view"
          href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.view_all_label }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

    </div>

  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">

    {% for collection in block.settings.collections limit: block.settings.collection_limit %}

      {% if collection != blank %}

        <a
          class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"
          href="{{ collection.url }}"
        >

          {% if block.settings.show_sale_badge %}

            {% assign collection_has_sale = false %}

            {% for product in collection.products %}

              {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                {% assign collection_has_sale = true %}
                {% break %}
              {% endif %}

            {% endfor %}

            {% if collection_has_sale %}
              <span class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale">
                {{ block.settings.sale_badge_label }}
              </span>
            {% endif %}

          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">

            {% if collection.featured_image %}

              <img
                src="{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}"
                alt="{{ collection.featured_image.alt | default: collection.title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >

            {% else %}

              {{ 'collection-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}

            {% endif %}

          </div>

          <h3 class="ai-collections-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">
            {{ collection.title }}
          </h3>

        </a>

      {% endif %}

    {% endfor %}

  </div>

</div>

